  m_text: "<size=150%><b>CREDITS</b></size>\n\n<b>PROJECT TEAM</b>\nXaviery Bonson Padaoan\nReginald Jervaise Chan\n\n<b>ART, UI & ICONS \u2014 KENNEY</b>\nTower Defense (Top-Down)\nUI Pack \u2022 Game Icons\nCC0 1.0 Universal\n\n<b>VISUAL EFFECTS \u2014 JEAN MORENO</b>\nCartoon FX Remaster Free\n\n<b>SOUND EFFECTS \u2014 DUSTYROOM</b>\nFREE Casual Game SFX Pack\n\n<b>SOUND EFFECTS \u2014 OLIVIER GIRARDOT</b>\nFree Sound Effects Pack Starter - All categories\n\n<b>SOUND EFFECTS \u2014 FANTACODE STUDIOS</b>\nFS Shooter System 2 \u2014 SFX Demo Audios\n\n<b>FLAMETHROWER SOUND \u2014 RAPHAVPIRES</b>\nFlamethrower (loop) \u2014 Freesound\nCC0 1.0 Universal\n\n<b>SOUND EFFECTS \u2014 MORE MOUNTAINS</b>\nFeel \u2014 SFX\n\n<b>SOUND EFFECT \u2014 KIDDPARK</b>\nCash Register \u2014 Freesound\nCC BY 4.0\nhttps://freesound.org/people/kiddpark/sounds/201159/\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n\n<b>MUSIC \u2014 ANDREW SITKOV MUSIC</b>\nFREE Battle Music Pack\n\n<b>FONT \u2014 VERNON ADAMS</b>\nOswald \u2022 SIL Open Font License 1.1\n\n<size=80%>An Applied Mathematics in Games Midterm Project.\nAsset Store packs are used under the Standard Unity Asset Store EULA.\nFull asset links and license details are in the project README.</size>\n\n\n"
